<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    21.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
